<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Welcome to Nadoumi!</title>
  <style><%- include('../styles/email-base.css') %></style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="header">
      <div class="logo">Nadoumi</div>
      <h1>Welcome, <%= firstName %>! 🎉</h1>
    </div>
    
    <div class="welcome-banner">
      <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 18px; font-weight: 600;" class="text-warning">
        Your email has been verified successfully!
      </p>
    </div>
    
    <p>We're thrilled to have you join the Nadoumi community! Your account is now active and ready to use.</p>
    
    <div class="features">
      <h2>What you can do now:</h2>
      
      <div class="feature-item">
        <span class="feature-icon">🎓</span>
        <strong>Explore Scholarships</strong> - Browse available scholarships and university programs
      </div>
      
      <div class="feature-item">
        <span class="feature-icon">📝</span>
        <strong>Submit Applications</strong> - Apply for scholarships that match your profile
      </div>
      
      <div class="feature-item">
        <span class="feature-icon">📊</span>
        <strong>Track Your Progress</strong> - Monitor your application status in real-time
      </div>
      
      <div class="feature-item">
        <span class="feature-icon">💼</span>
        <strong>Manage Documents</strong> - Upload and organize your application documents
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="button-container">
      <a href="<%= frontendUrl || 'http://localhost:5173' %>/scholarships" class="button">
        Explore Scholarships
      </a>
    </div>
    
    <p>If you have any questions or need assistance, our support team is here to help. Just reach out to us anytime!</p>
    
    <div class="footer">
      <p>Thank you for choosing Nadoumi!</p>
      <p>&copy; <%= new Date().getFullYear() %> Nadoumi. All rights reserved.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
